<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="panel state loading">正在确认登录状态…</view><view wx:elif="{{!ready}}" class="panel state"><view class="state-title">请重新登录</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">去登录</button><button class="link" bindtap="home">游客浏览首页</button><button class="link" bindtap="enter">重试身份确认</button></view><block wx:else><view class="panel"><view class="section-title">账号设置</view><view class="username"><text class="muted">用户名（只读）</text><text>{{username}}</text></view><view class="field"><text class="label">原密码</text><input value="{{old_password}}" password maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy}}" data-field="old_password" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入当前密码"/><text wx:if="{{field === 'old_password'}}" class="field-error">{{error}}</text></view><view class="field"><text class="label">新密码</text><input value="{{new_password}}" password maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy}}" data-field="new_password" bindinput="input" placeholder="8—20位，包含字母和数字"/><text wx:if="{{field === 'new_password'}}" class="field-error">{{error}}</text></view><view class="field"><text class="label">确认新密码</text><input value="{{confirmation}}" password maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy}}" data-field="confirmation" bindinput="input" placeholder="请再次输入新密码"/><text wx:if="{{field === 'confirmation'}}" class="field-error">{{error}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="changePassword">{{busy ? '处理中…' : '保存新密码'}}</button><view class="hint spaced">修改成功后，所有旧版小程序登录凭据失效，需要重新登录。</view></view><view class="panel"><view class="section-title">结束登录</view><text class="muted">退出后仍可游客浏览。成功退出将撤销该账号旧版小程序登录凭据。</text><button class="danger spaced" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></view></block></view>
